    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Optical Illusions x One-Stroke Drawing \u2014 A Puzzle Journey to Weave the  Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Weaver of the Cosmos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perspective as your weapon, and a single stroke as your order,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting scattered stars, filling the empty void of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Optical Illusions: The Space is Not What It Seems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=336 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From different angles, the structure of the world will shift.<br>Align scattered points to make them appear connected, creating a one-stroke path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Special Mechanisms: Curves, Wormholes...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=398 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wormholes</strong>: Connecting to one also connects its counterpart.<br><strong>Curves</strong>: The complexity of the levels increases, adding new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Whispers of the Cosmos: Every Step Listens to the Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a whisper from the cosmos.<br>The optimal solution will reveal a deeper &quot;confession&quot;, unveiling the fuller story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Visuals and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=560 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Fantastical and Mysterious Cosmo</strong> \u2014 Explore the order within pure and beautiful geometric space.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Dynamic Cosmic Background</strong> \u2014 As you solve puzzles, the shape of the world subtly changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 This is More Than Just a Puzzle...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rules may seem logical, but feel subtly flawed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you truly solving the puzzle, or falling deeper into the maze?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths might only be discovered in the next cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... dark trials await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Space Puzzle Enthusiasts</strong> \u2014 Enjoy the novel solutions brought by perspective shifts.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Players Who Love Immersive Experiences</strong> \u2014 For those who appreciate atmosphere, art, and storytelling.<br>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Thinkers Who Uncover Hidden Secrets</strong> \u2014 Can you discern the true rules behind the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Are you ready to face the trials?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Optical Illusions x One-Stroke Drawing \u2014 A Puzzle Journey to Weave the  Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Weaver of the Cosmos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perspective as your weapon, and a single stroke as your order,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting scattered stars, filling the empty void of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Optical Illusions: The Space is Not What It Seems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=336 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/e27e0d50340c8db8695e5a0af999f710.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From different angles, the structure of the world will shift.<br>Align scattered points to make them appear connected, creating a one-stroke path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Special Mechanisms: Curves, Wormholes...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=398 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/bcd327b02b17136a477bb515d2b30542.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wormholes</strong>: Connecting to one also connects its counterpart.<br><strong>Curves</strong>: The complexity of the levels increases, adding new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c7 <strong>Whispers of the Cosmos: Every Step Listens to the Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/5f239a235ea4ce54221e7fdaf826b6ab.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a whisper from the cosmos.<br>The optimal solution will reveal a deeper &quot;confession&quot;, unveiling the fuller story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Visuals and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.poster.avif?t=1752509374\" width=560 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.webm?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413210/extras/834012072051280b977af4595ff70e49.mp4?t=1752509374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Fantastical and Mysterious Cosmo</strong> \u2014 Explore the order within pure and beautiful geometric space.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Dynamic Cosmic Background</strong> \u2014 As you solve puzzles, the shape of the world subtly changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 This is More Than Just a Puzzle...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rules may seem logical, but feel subtly flawed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you truly solving the puzzle, or falling deeper into the maze?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths might only be discovered in the next cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... dark trials await.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Space Puzzle Enthusiasts</strong> \u2014 Enjoy the novel solutions brought by perspective shifts.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Players Who Love Immersive Experiences</strong> \u2014 For those who appreciate atmosphere, art, and storytelling.<br>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Thinkers Who Uncover Hidden Secrets</strong> \u2014 Can you discern the true rules behind the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Are you ready to face the trials?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A narrative-driven puzzle game that combines &quot;optical illusions&quot; with &quot;single-stroke puzzle&quot; as its theme. Players rotate their perspective in a 3D space, using optical illusions to connect vertexes and segments, completing the patterns in each level with a single stroke.",
